anime-offline-database — manami-project
https://github.com/manami-project/anime-offline-database
Licensed under the Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0 and the Database Contents
License (DbCL) v1.0.

Contributes the facts behind every season, movie and special in data/: titles,
release year and season, episode counts, and the cross-provider ids (AniList,
AniDB, MyAnimeList, Kitsu) used to join records.

Its titles and synonyms are also read to work out which of its entries each
installment should be, and a disagreement with the authored anilistId is
reported. That is a check on this project's own editorial choice, not a fact
taken from the source; the anilistId itself remains authored here.

Because data/ is a derivative database of this source, it is offered under the
same ODbL + DbCL terms. See LICENSE-DATA.

